<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets corridor warrants on DEM/USD.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets corridor warrants on DEM/USD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 15 million European-style, plus/minus currency range warrants, in five equal tranches, on the official mid-fixing of the mark/U.S. dollar, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   30.OCT.96		 SPOT REFERENCE  1.5425</p>
<p> WARRANTS	RANGE	  PRICE	 YIELD	  MATURITY</p>
<p> TRANCHE IX    1.45-1.55    3.79 DEM    270.62 PCT   05.JUN.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE X     1.48-1.58    4.70 DEM    186.24 PCT   05.JUN.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE XI    1.50-1.60    4.46 DEM    205.15 PCT   05.JUN.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE XII   1.52-1.62    3.69 DEM    282.43 PCT   05.JUN.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE XIII  1.50-1.58    6.49 DEM    205.63 PCT   31.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
